{"text": "The next morning was bright and sunny, and the paw on the sideboard now looked harmless and a little silly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Herbert laughed at his parents once more, and then he left for the factory where he worked every day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That afternoon, Missus White noticed a well dressed stranger who was walking back and forth outside the gate. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Finally he came in, looking nervous, and said that he had been sent by Maw and Meggins, Herberts company. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Has something happened to Herbert, Missus White asked, her voice shaking with fear. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The visitor said quietly that Herbert had been caught in the machines, and the old couple understood that their son was dead. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old man took his wifes hand and held it tightly, just as he had done forty years before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The company said that it was not responsible, but it wished to give them some money for their loss. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How much, asked Mister White in a dry voice, and the visitor answered, Two hundred pounds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hearing those words, Missus White screamed, and Mister White fainted and fell to the floor.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "n", "e", "x", "t", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "b", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "u", "n", "n", "y", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "a", "w", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "i", "d", "e", "b", "o", "a", "r", "d", " ", "n", "o", "w", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "h", "a", "r", "m", "l", "e", "s", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "s", "i", "l", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", "r", "b", "e", "r", "t", " ", "l", "a", "u", "g", "h", "e", "d", " ",